Package: helpbuoy
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Maurits van der Schee <maurits@vdschee.nl>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/helpbuoy/helpbuoy
Description: client for helpbuoy self-hosted remote support
 helpbuoy lets a support techie (helpbuoy-desk) see and control this
 computer's screen through a helpbuoy-server. The screen and input run
 end to end over an inner SSH connection the server can't read.
 .
 It is a single static binary that speaks the X11 protocol itself, so it
 needs no libraries. It can't share a Wayland desktop; log in with an X11
 session instead.
